{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-run-phone-onboarding-db-a-01","date":"2026-11-24","lens":"6","surface":"phone","area":"phone/onboarding-db","refs":["F-phone-1602","F-phone-1608","F-phone-1621","FN-L14-phone-lib-core-03"],"severity":"S3","title":"Setup, demo and home summary failures say Try again but keep no note of why","what":"When saving the 3 setup answers fails, the member sees 'Could not save your details. Please try again.' When loading the demo fails, 'Could not load the demo. Please try again.' When the home numbers cannot be read, Home shows its Try again line. In all three the reason is thrown away: nothing is written even to the phone's own log, and the shared save line does not log failures either. A member stuck at the last setup step cannot get into the app, and nobody can find out why.","expected":"Every Try again line keeps a note of the real reason, so a phone test or a crash report can show what went wrong.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/onboarding/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx:493-501","apps/mobile/src/onboarding/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx:515-518","apps/mobile/src/store/dashboardStore.ts:61-63","apps/mobile/src/db/writeQueue.ts:34-38"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"try-again-without-a-log","who":"new members and members opening Home","how_often":"each time a save or read fails (rare)","fix_line":"Log the reason before showing each Try again line","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-run-phone-onboarding-db-a-02","date":"2026-11-24","lens":"6","surface":"phone","area":"phone/onboarding-db","refs":["F-phone-1604","FN-L8-phone-onboarding-db-01","FN-L14-phone-onboarding-db-03"],"severity":"S3","title":"While waiting for the WhatsApp check, losing the internet or a MettleUp outage shows nothing","what":"After the member sends the WhatsApp message and comes back, the app asks MettleUp every 3 seconds whether it arrived. If the phone has no internet, or MettleUp answers with a server fault, the answer is treated as 'not yet' and the screen keeps saying 'Send the message in WhatsApp' with no word that something is wrong. The member waits, thinks the message did not arrive, and may send it again or give up. Only a manual Start again gets them out.","expected":"After a few failed asks, the screen says the phone is offline or MettleUp is not answering, and that the message they sent still counts once it is back.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/shop/findGymApi.ts:58-66","apps/mobile/src/onboarding/components/WelcomePhone.tsx:173-195","apps/mobile/src/onboarding/phoneSignIn.ts:240-243"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"check-wait-hides-outage","who":"new members signing in by phone number","how_often":"whenever the internet drops or the server fails during the check","fix_line":"Count failed asks and show an offline or server-down line after a few","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
